invariant: INV-13
file: io.c
catches: unit
reason: io_send_all takes a send that answers 0 as progress and calls it
  again, so a send that moves nothing keeps the session in its loop.
  bin/unit's send that answers 0 once counts the second call.

--- old
        if (sent <= 0 || (size_t)sent > n) {
--- new
        if (sent < 0 || (size_t)sent > n) {
